"<h2>1. Introduction</h2>\n<p>Welcome to <strong>Nitrobase</strong> (\"we\", \"our\", or \"us\"). We are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring you have complete control over your data. Because Nitrobase is built specifically for self-hosting Supabase and related backend infrastructure on your own servers, your core database records and sensitive application data remain exclusively under your control.</p>\n<p>This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and the choices available to you when you use our website, deployment dashboard, and associated services.</p>\n<h2>2. Our Core Philosophy: Your Infrastructure, Your Data</h2>\n<p>Unlike closed proprietary Cloud DB providers:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>We never store your database rows, tables, or client records.</strong> All databases, storage buckets, and auth schemas run directly within Docker containers deployed on your designated VPS server.</li>\n<li><strong>Direct SSH &#x26; API Connections:</strong> Connection keys and server tokens used for one-click setup are encrypted with AES-256-GCM. We do not inspect your private database traffic.</li>\n<li><strong>Complete Portability:</strong> You retain the freedom to export, migrate, or destroy your self-hosted instances at any time without vendor lock-in.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>3. Information We Collect</h2>\n<h3>A. Account &#x26; Authentication Information</h3>\n<p>When you create an account or sign in to Nitrobase, we collect:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Your email address.</li>\n<li>Your authentication credentials or third-party OAuth IDs (e.g., GitHub or Google profile identifiers).</li>\n<li>Your workspace and user profile settings.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>B. Server Configuration Metadata</h3>\n<p>To automate deployment and system health monitoring, our platform processes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>VPS provider details (e.g., Hetzner, Vultr, DigitalOcean, or custom IP addresses).</li>\n<li>Operating system version (e.g., Ubuntu 22.04 / 24.04 LTS).</li>\n<li>System resource specifications (CPU, RAM, storage allocations).</li>\n<li>Deployment logs and health status pings.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>C. Technical &#x26; Usage Data</h3>\n<p>When you navigate our website, we may automatically collect standard diagnostic metrics:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Device type, browser user agent, IP address, and preferred locale.</li>\n<li>Page interaction duration and referring URLs.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>4. How We Use Your Information</h2>\n<p>We use the collected information for the following purposes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Provisioning &#x26; Management:</strong> Enabling one-click deployment, container orchestration, and automated backup configurations.</li>\n<li><strong>Platform Security:</strong> Authenticating accounts, detecting fraudulent activities, and mitigating security threats.</li>\n<li><strong>Service Communications:</strong> Sending critical deployment notifications, backup failure alerts, and security patches.</li>\n<li><strong>Product Improvements:</strong> Analyzing non-identifiable usage statistics to optimize deployment scripts and CLI tools.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>5. Data Security &#x26; Retention</h2>\n<p>We implement modern industry-standard security safeguards:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Encryption at Rest &#x26; in Transit:</strong> All communications with Nitrobase are secured via TLS 1.3. Server keys are stored using hardware-level encryption mechanisms.</li>\n<li><strong>Zero Third-Party Data Selling:</strong> We do not sell, rent, or monetize your personal or infrastructure information.</li>\n<li><strong>Account Deletion:</strong> You can request account deletion at any time. Upon deletion, all associated configuration tokens and deployment profiles are permanently purged.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>6. Your Rights</h2>\n<p>Depending on your jurisdiction (such as GDPR in the EU or CCPA in California), you have rights regarding your personal information, including:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The right to access and obtain a copy of your stored account data.</li>\n<li>The right to rectify inaccurate information.</li>\n<li>The right to erasure (\"Right to be Forgotten\").</li>\n<li>The right to data portability.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>7. Contact Us</h2>\n<p>If you have any questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy or our security practices, please contact our privacy team at:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Email:</strong> hoagminhit@gmail.com</li>\n<li><strong>Discord Community:</strong> https://discord.com</li>\n<li><strong>Website:</strong> https://nitrobase.app</li>\n</ul>"